<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-18T18:45:10.659Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:45:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has formally allied with the M23 rebels, creating a coalition that is now attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and the wounding of former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. In Ituri, suspected ADF rebels killed 77 civilians. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsNation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NZ Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQOFRVQ2hhQWNqTlg1STVjQ09vaVJvdHpFR3M3OGZPVF9NSEdEYmVxOGFpSm5hbWhhRzFmcTIxNkRJbkhqRW5heVVFcU9BYkRqYy0yWlFmNUtjVUUwQUtZWVVjUXdNcWNfTDFqWmpGZzVQOHRBbHltVGtCVW1DQW5DRDlyeEpKTngxclB5bWpYY1ZuRVl5em9LMGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Şafak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQbkpyOFFNSlJpYXg2dzFiMDg4RExNdzlWcXdNZHJWTkVza28tTnlhQ0d6TlVEMnJQbW1ZMkdFM3lsQ2xibjRMUVFvZWRhYllZTkpfRkh6MjJvbGhxejdTNzBUQURudkdYbEN0VVNFVWlCQkV2dHh5WGU1MWxDeEU3NS05NFNVUy0xdXpnaHN4V0tPVmNBZmRxQUJna25SZkR0aGxRX3dCRnhvaGh1czI5ZUZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9LNkpzUUVyby1PNFgzcE9PX0ZCTGhyT0UyQkk0RmUzcmxocmFwOHBlY2xndm9PZGkzRVJQd3owc3NJYzdQUXZaOXVtNnJUUjVOVk5wZW1KZ05TaVdjSlI3RVFpOE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&